{
  "id": "EPH.6",
  "number": "6",
  "bookId": "EPH",
  "reference": "Efeso 6",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 24,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EPH 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bana, tumikilai baledi benu mu Mukelenge; bua bualu ebu budi buakane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Unemeke tatu webe ne mamu webe (eu udi mukenshi wa kumudilu udi ne mulayi), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bua wewe wikale ne dikasa dimpe ne wikale ne muoyo musangu mule ha buloba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne nuenu batatu, kanufuishi bana benu balela tshishi; nubadiundishe bimpe ne dihela ne didimusha bia Mukelenge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuenu bahika, tumikilai dî dia badi banfumu benu ba mu malu a ha buloba ne kutshina ne kuzakala ne mutshima umue, bu munudi nutumikila Kilisto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanuenji mudimu bu bahika ba mesu, badi bu basankishi ba bantu; kadi bu bahika ba Kilisto, nuenze bu mudi disua dia Nzambi ne mitshima yenu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nuenze mudimu ne disanka bu munudi nuenzela Mukelenge mudimu, kembu munudi nuenzela bantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nudi bamanye bienu ne, Bualu buonso buimpe budi muntu ne muntu wenza, buobuo mene mbudiye wangata kabidi kudi Mukelenge, bikaleye muhika anyi mudishikamine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne nuenu banfumu, nubenzele muomumue, nuhidie kubakanyina; mimanye ne, Mukelenge wabo ne wenu kabidi udi mu diulu, ne kakuena kansungunsungu kudiye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku ndekelu, nudikoleshe mu Mukelenge ne mu bukole buandi bunene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luatai bintu bionso bia nvita bia Nzambi, bua nuenu numanye mua kuimana bakandamana ku mpala kua mateyi a diabolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua diluangana dietu dia bibula kadiena dia kufuilangana ne munyinyi ne mashi, kadi ndia kufuilangana ne makelenge ne makokeshi ne banfumu ba midima ba buloba ebu, ne bisumbu bia nyuma mibi bidi mu miaba ya mu diulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua muanda eu angatai bintu bionso bia nvita bia Nzambi, bua nuenu numanye mua kudimanyika bimpe halua dituku dibi, ne, hanuashikisha kuenza malu onso, nudi mua kuimana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku imanai bienu, bamane kusuika bulelela mu bifuka bienu bu mukaba, bamane kuteka buakane bu tshibuikilu tshia ha tshiadi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bamane kubuesha makasa enu mu bisabata bia kudilongolola kua lumu luimpe lua ditalala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha mutu ha bintu bionso nuambule ngabu wa ditabusha, unudi mua kuehela nʼandi miketa yonso ya Satana idi ne kahia kasuikaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuangate tshifulu tshia luhandu, ne muele wa Nyuma udi dî dia Nzambi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nutendelele Nzambi misangu yonso ne kulomba kuonso ne disengelela dionso mu Nyuma Mumpe; nuikale batabale mu dinanukila dionso ne disengelela bua basanto bonso, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne bua bualu buanyi kabidi, bua meme kuheshibua mua kuakula hanabulula mukana muanyi ne bua meme kumanyisha bantu ne dikima bualu bua lumu luimpe busokoka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua bualu ebu ndi muloho wa Nzambi mu nkanu, bua meme kuambila bantu bualu ne dikima bu mundi nʼabu bua kubambila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua nuenu kabidi numanye malu andi nʼau ne mundi ngenza, Tukiko, muanʼetu munanga wa mu Kilisto, muena mudimu wa lulamatu mu Mukelenge, nennumanyishe malu onso; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "unakanutumina bua muanda eu mene, bua nuenu numanye bu mutudi emu, ne bua kusambeye mitshima yenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ditalala dikale kudi bana betu ba mu Kilisto, ne dinanga disangisha ne ditabusha bia kudi Nzambi Tatu ne kudi Mukelenge Yesu Kilisto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngasa ikale ne bantu bonso badi bananga Mukelenge wetu Yesu Kilisto ne dinanga didi kadi mua kuhanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
